  "steps": [
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Choose a topic</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Check F2 for vibration or knocking</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Choose the front, blade or rear. You need not check every part.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> No power while you repair. Work only on guards, blade and fasteners.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Front guard</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Check the front guard rim</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Look at the rim marks and clip.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Marks align, rim flush, clip closed. Fitted with the marks offset or the clip open is not locked.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Front guard</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Remove the front guard: open the clip, turn to the mark, pull off</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Press Trigger once at the clip, then hold the guard rim with Grip.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> The blade and cap are visible.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Blade and cap</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Check the blade and its cap</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>The cap is the round part at the blade centre.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Blade fully on pin, cap tight. A threaded cap may still be loose.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Blade and cap</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Remove the blade: unthread its cap, then pull the blade off</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Cap: hold Trigger, turn clockwise from the front. Blade: hold Grip, pull along the shaft.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> The ring around the shaft is visible.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Rear guard</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Try moving the rear guard rim</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Hold the visible outer rim with Grip.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> The rim stays still. A threaded ring may still be loose.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Rear guard</color></size>\n<size=46><b>To realign the rear guard, unthread the ring and pull it off</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Hold Trigger. Turn counterclockwise from the front until it is free.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> The guard can be realigned.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Rear guard</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Align the rear guard, refit the ring and tighten it</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Guard: hold Grip. Ring: hold Trigger, turn clockwise from the front.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> The guard rim stays still.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Reassemble</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Refit the blade with its groove on the pin, then tighten the cap</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Blade: hold Grip, push fully in. Cap: hold Trigger, turn counterclockwise from the front.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Blade fully seated, cap tight.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Reassemble</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Refit the front guard, turn it to lock, then close the clip</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>Hold the rim with Grip, push flush and turn. Press Trigger once at the clip.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Both guards fitted, clip closed.</color></size>"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "<size=24><color=#5B6B7F>Check my work</color></size>\n<size=46><b>Select Check my work on the task panel and listen</b></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#4A5A6E>It runs for 3 seconds, before or after repair. Missing guards prevent the test. Report system faults to the researcher.</color></size>\n\n<size=34><color=#2E7D32><b>✓</b> Passed and ready means done. Abnormal noise means looseness or misalignment remains; correct it and test again.</color></size>"
    }
  ],
